    }

    /// `self` without the rows `i .. i + n` (`i + n <= 3`; panics with `nalgebra: index out of
    /// bounds` otherwise), a `MatrixXx6` (`DMatrix`). Upstream: `remove_rows` (`OMatrix<U3, Dyn>`).
    #[inline]
